Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak, thousands of Kaiba Corp\Ncomputer files are being deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanction no small part\Nto my undefeatable virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If what Siegfried says is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then Yugi has to get rid\Nof that castle card pronto,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,or Kaiba's gonna lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried reprogrammed the card\Nand made it indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Running from our problems, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't run from anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm faced with a problem,\NI eliminate the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you fools realize I've already won?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't mean to\Ntrigger that virus, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But with your help, I\Nthink we can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to duel with all of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Leon stays\Nstrong and doesn't give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we're bound to find that\Ncard's weakness. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there's nothing I\Ncan do to change the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can work with you\Nto change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know there's a\Nsolution to this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And if anyone can figure it out, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Castle of Stralberg's special\Neffect is now automatically activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with\NYuki's Dark Magician Girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Dark Magician Girl's destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And Cinderella's got her slippers back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.05,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as my new and improved castle\Nremains on the field, both players'
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters will be forced\Nto do battle each turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And as an added twist, whenever one\Nof your monsters is forced to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,half of that monster's attack points\Nare then deducted from your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the monster itself is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he really make a card do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he just did, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiate protocol KC-514.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't allow this thing\Nto spread any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what can I do to help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take charge of E-level security and\Nmake sure every firewall stays active.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He would have done anything\Nto help his big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did Ziegfrey repay him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With lies and betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother would never do that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I destroy that castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic and trap cards\Nare useless against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And any monster I summon will\Nself-destruct and drain my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the use?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon, we can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every card has a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as we continue\Nto duel to the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll find a way to tear that castle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place this face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I can do this. Yugi's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quitting is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one more thing\Nyou should know Golden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle comes with a price\NIn order to keep it on the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,field Half the cards in\None's deck must be sent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,directly to the graveyard at\Nthe start of each turn Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and this cost must be paid by Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding. Congratulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried. You've just taken\Ncheating to a whole new level. Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the strongest card I've\Never seen. What? Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When Siegfried broke into\NKaiba's gaming system,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,he gave his golden castle powers\Nthat no card has ever had before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,giving the cardholder an unfair advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You give the one with a disadvantage\Nhere, so you should really be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He just lost half his deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be up here in the grandstand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean I can't\Ncontrol this duel. He's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,my brother will hold\Nthe world championship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Crown but Kyber Corp\Nwill crumble into ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd summon a monster, Leon.\NThis is a duel, after all. He's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'll summon\NForest Wolf in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the special effect of Golden Castle\Nforces Leon's monsters to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is defenseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forest Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my face-down card,\NDark Magic Retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When my opponent's monster attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Retribution allows me to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,one spellcaster back\Nfrom my card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose my Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She only remains on the field\Nfor the duration of the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's long enough for me to\Ndefend the remainder of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Be safe, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even control my own monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, since three turns have passed\Nsince you played Spinning Wheel Spindle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,my Queen's Knight returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For my next move, I'll place these\Ntwo cards face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my card of sanctity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows\Nboth players to draw
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,until we're each holding\Nsix cards in our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon my King's\NKnight in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And since King's Knight and Queen's\NKnight are both on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to summon Jack's Knight\Nfrom my deck to join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're through wasting everyone's time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,may I remind you your three knights\Nare useless against my golden castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate my Royal Straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to summon an
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,extremely powerful monster\Nfrom either my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my hand, or my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So behold, Royal Straight Slasher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And next I'll activate my Royal\NStraight Slasher's special ability now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,when i send one monster from each of\Nthe first five levels to the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,slasher destroys every card on my\Nopponent's side of the field nice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking yuki trap and magic cards\Ndon't work but monster abilities do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 1, Karibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 2, my old vindictive magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 3, giant soldier of stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 4, my big shield gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 5, my curse of dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, destroy all of his cards.\NIncluding his golden castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still there. Siegfried was right.\NWe'll never be able to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that castle still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't it have been destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be a sand\Ncastle Surprise, surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,don't even tell me when Siegfried\Noverwrote the card's data text
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have protected his golden\Ncastle from monster effects
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,also That means there's no way\Nto get rid of it Then I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel's done, right? You not if\NI activate this card time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to temporarily\Nremove one of my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,from the field until my\Nopponent's turn begins
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How noble of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster would have been forced\Nto attack, and Leon would have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Leon, begin your turn so you\Ncan claim the championship crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how you're going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know you'll put an end to his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,deposit half your deck in the\Ngraveyard to keep my castle in play!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, but\NI can't do that. You must!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one card left in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it impossible for me to\Ndeposit half of it into the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suppose your golden castle\Nof Stromberg has to go. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You mess with the best and\Nyou fail like the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like the perfect card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried designed it to be impervious to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the effects of every\Nother card in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, everything\Nhas its weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And with your grandson's refusal\Nto give in, he was able to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to cut this thing off\Nbefore any other files are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The virus just stopped dead in its tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Yu-Gi found its\Nweak spot after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything's safe now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll know as soon as we launch the\Nbackup system and reboot the KC mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of Zig Freak! Oh well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You schemed, you cheated,\Nand you still lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit I'm surprised Yugi was\Nable to dismantle my golden castle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, it's over,\Npal On the contrary,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my young and fashionably\Nchallenged friend My conquest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.01,0:12:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,has only just begun You\Nmay have stopped my virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but not soon enough By now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of Kyber Corp's gaming data\Nhas been permanently lost. Not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to mention Yugi has one card left\NAnd this duel is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When he's unable to draw a card\Nin the next turn, my brother wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Yugi lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when my brother cheated\Nhim out of his title.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way I can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your brother's castle\Nis gone, the real duel can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe it to yourself to fulfill your\Ndream and see this duel through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.95,0:12:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's do it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it was your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, since the effect of my time\Ntravel card is over, my slasher returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to bring\NCinderella back from the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And with her back in action,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can automatically summon my\Npumpkin carriage to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll sacrifice Cinderella\Nand Pumpkin Carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That allows me to call\NHextrude to the field
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Trudy. Attack his Slasher
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And every time my Hextrude\Nblows away one of your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters her attack strength\Nincreases by 400 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi, let's\Nsee what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi only has one card left, and he's\Nup against a monster with 3,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he runs out of cards, he loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I hate to say it, but it looks\Nlike there's a new champ in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, heart of the cards, guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll activate this\Ncard, Emergency Provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I send one of my magic\Nor trap cards to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency Provisions will restore\Na thousand of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate this, Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it to summon a\Nmonster you might know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, he only has\N2,500 attack points, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And my Hextrude has 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but now I reveal this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Necromancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Its special effect brings back four\Nrandom monsters from your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they're summoned to your\Nside of the field in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But your Hextrude will\Nlose 600 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,for every one of these\Nmonsters that's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I reveal my next face-down\Ncard, Diffusion Wave Motion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By sacrificing 1,000 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Diffusion Wave Motion\Nallows me to use my Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician to attack every\None of your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't! I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby! He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He never ceases to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought with honor under the toughest\Nof circumstances, and you never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you stop your whimpering?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a total loss. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take years of reprogramming\Nfor Kyber Corp to restore
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,what my devastatingly brilliant\Ncomputer virus has destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the meantime... You'll what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take all of my business away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You might have had a chance if your\Nplan actually worked, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I laid eyes on\Nyou, I knew you were a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was more than prepared\Nfor your little scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire computer network\Nhas already been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So the only loser here is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My strategy was flawless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, even if your plan did\Nwork, nothing would have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.81,0:17:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see our family's obsession\Nwith the Kaiba's has ruined us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's ruined us, Leon, is that I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first sensible\Nthing he said all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not our family's losses\Nthat hurt us; it's our attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength isn't crushing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling Yugi taught me\Nthe true strength is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,sticking with it when everyone\Nexpects you to quit Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We may lose some of our\Nbusiness to KaibaCorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but losing is a reason to try\Nharder Not to give up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go home and make\NSchroederCorp the best company we can
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Leon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, wrap this up Right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The KC Grand Championship\Nhas come to a close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner and still\Nworld champ is Yukimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fun, but I'm ready to go back,\Nand I'm ready for a home-cooked meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,let's not drag out this goodbye because\Ni'll be in your neighborhood in a few weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.61,0:18:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,cool why's that duke i've got a date
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,with serenity say what ah what i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,To be a young man again, I still feel\Nas nimble. That is the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what was that you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't forget you promised to email\Nme twice a day and visit every weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been interesting, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Shmoopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.49,0:19:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And Taya, I'm gonna miss you, too. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I hook you up with our jet, and you\Ndon't have the courtesy to board on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I call the window seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you got it last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So now that you won the\Nchampionship, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Joey, the sky's the limit.
